#### `isToolUIPart` → `isStaticToolUIPart`

The `isToolUIPart` function has been renamed to `isStaticToolUIPart` to clarify that it checks for static tool parts only.

```tsx title="AI SDK 5"
import { isToolUIPart } from 'ai';

